<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada excess settlement balances.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada excess settlement balances.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada's computed cumulative excess settlement balances for the period from September 19 to September 25 was C$263 million, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
